      },
      "publishTime": "2026-04-07T05:51:45.245254091Z",
      "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ka2NXbGpjR2RZVFc1TVJHSlFhMWxuWVc1M09WRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ka2NXbGpjR2RZVFc1TVJHSlFhMWxuWVc1M09WRRAB!2m1!1s0x2e698d247869059d:0xdca54eb102fb4e81"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJnQVpeCSNaS4RgU77ArFOpdw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5WmVIUlpSRzlxYVhZMVdqRmlhRTlEVEVGaU5YYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Came here and was genuinely impressed. De 92 Degrees has everything you need for work, hangouts, or events. Here’s the full breakdown:\n\nWhat I loved:\n- Space & Facilities: It’s a huge 4-floor building. Parking is adequate for both motorbikes and cars, which is a big plus in East Jakarta. They also have a lift to access the 3rd & 4th floor, so it’s convenient.\n- Food & Drinks: Super affordable and genuinely tasty. I ordered the Vietnam Drip and Pisang Caramel and both were 9/10. The menu is also very diverse, from light snacks to heavy meals, so everyone’s covered.\n- Zoning: 2nd floor is dedicated non-smoking, perfect if you want to work or chill without smoke. 3rd floor has an indoor smoking area so you won’t get overheated during the day. 4th floor is smoking area with the best spot to catch the sunset in the afternoon.\n- Events: The 3rd floor can be booked for meetings, seminars, bukber, or other intimate events with a capacity of up to 100 people. Great option for community gatherings.\n- Service: Staff were attentive and really friendly. Don’t hesitate to ask for anything! Just ask politely and they’ll help you right away.\n\nFloor Guide:\n- Floor 2 = Non-smoking\n- Floor 3 = Indoor smoking + event space\n- Floor 4 = Smoking area + sunset view\n- Lift available to 3rd & 4th floor\n\nVerdict: For the space, food quality, price, and service, this place is a 10/10. Whether you want to WFC, hangout, or host an event, De 92 Degrees has you covered. Will definitely be back!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
