    {
      "name": "places/ChIJnQVpeCSNaS4RgU77ArFOpdw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oM2IxOHpibTFOZUhkeFdVUlRRWEI1Y2s1TFlYYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "Came here at lunch time, warm welcoming by a friendly receptionist girl (unfortunately i forgot the name) her service was excellent. She was followed us upstairs to make sure we have a seat & serve well.\nShe was busy arrange our seats while her mates (a man) just starring without help, until my husband told him to help her. She worth to have award 👏🏻\n\nNice ambience but unfortunately the food (dori, chicken, tempe & tofu) were not tasty, seems lack of marinated. The chicken was over cooked (too brown & a bit hard) but the sayur asem, nasi liwet & drink was okay.\nThe toilet was clean but better put a garbage bin inside the bathroom.\nThe parking lot was very narrow (only 2/3 cars) but they provide & charged 15k for vallet service (which supposedly not charge to customer).",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
